WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.050
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:11.460
You'll be defeated by the same 
people you're trying to save.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.190
This is a nightmare.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.200
If Bohman is telling the truth...

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.670
...the Neuron Link will keep sacrificing 
people logged into LINK VRAINS.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:24.670
We must stop this immediately.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:31.640
Tackling a system this large 
makes me tremble with excitement.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:37.250
Pull apart the two LINK VRAINS by straining 
it from both the inside and outside.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.460
That's right.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:43.310
The chance arises when large amounts 
of data are created inside LINK VRAINS.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.630
In other words, when Bohman 
activates his Skill.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.200
What's that?

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.100
Call it a virus bomb.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.070
It should be effective for this plan.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.940
Playmaker, I thank you from my heart.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.680
You're the one who developed my heart.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.040
The ultimate world will soon be created.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.830
From all possibilities, I'll 
choose the ideal world.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.020
A world that will lead to the ideal path.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.390
But it won't be a fair one!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.390
There's no need for that.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:28.400
Since I'll unite everything into a single 
ultimate thought, only I should exist.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.250
The ultimate ideal is a single existence.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:37.880
That'll bring peace and 
lead to a glorious world.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.810
You're lonely.

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:43.550
I'm lonely?

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:48.750
When I was lonely, I only had 
a futile desire for revenge.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.240
But I met many friends.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.500
While we clashed at times, my views expanded.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:02.500
There's something you can see for the 
first time by listen to your friends.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.070
By accepting each other.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.830
I'll live together with the Ignis!

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.010
I believe in an open future!

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:33.280
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:40.070
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:47.390
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:53.960
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:53.960 --> 00:03:00.710
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:07.940
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:14.650
I want to share your pain

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.840
When Bohman activates his 
Skill, that's our big chance.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:57.620
If the Neuron Link takes down Zaizen 
and Ghost Girl, it’s all over.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:01.090
Let’s do everything to crush him.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.340
After seeing how bad it is, 
the logins have decreased.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.340
I don’t want any more victims.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.810
We must stop Bohman.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.280
How’s that!

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.990
It has more ATK than Dragrid!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:39.960
Ai, did you forget about your last turn?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:50.440
As your last-ditch effort to defeat Chimera 
Hydradrive Dragrid, you summoned Quantum Dragon.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.900
That was then, this is now!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.520
But it didn’t work.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:02.880
The many voices inside me 
will determine my best move.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:11.120
Due to the Neuron Link, it’s as if 
you’re battling every human in LINK VRAINS.

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:19.940
The Neuron Link is analyzing 
Playmaker's information.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:29.510
Even if I’m facing that many people, 
there’s only one I need to defeat.  You, Bohman!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.610
You can’t win, Playmaker.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:41.710
As long as he has his Neuron Link, 
he’ll activate his Skill again.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:46.960
When he does, he might avoid 
Clock Dragon’s attack.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:51.930
We have to do something 
about his Neuron Link.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.680
Playmaker, can you hear me?

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:57.750
It’s Faust.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.140
Don’t answer.  Bohman will notice.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:07.150
Many in LINK VRAINS have fallen 
victim to the Neuron Link.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:13.890
We, along with Zaizen and Ghost Girl in 
LINK VRAINS, will stop the Neuron Link.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.350
That will be your best 
chance to defeat Bohman.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.500
I activate my Skill!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.700
Here comes his next Skill!

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.830
Bohman activated his Skill!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.680
We’re ready.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.500
Here we go!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.100
Oh no!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.960
Security is preventing the 
virus bomb from activating.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.300
We have to blow it up manually.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.290
Leave it to me.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.040
I’m more familiar with SOL’s security.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:19.180
Our attack is successful.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.650
Now we need LINK VRAINS's side to attack.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:28.310
So you're the reasons 
why I had a bad feeling.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:30.830
Zaizen and Ghost Girl!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.630
And the Knights of Hanoi!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.370
Oh no!  He found out!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.840
Okay!  It can now explode!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.210
Emma!

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.060
I leave the rest to you.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.770
Don’t mess up, Akira.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.060
Activating virus bomb!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:14.800
They’re attacking the Neuron Link’s weak 
point from both the inside and outside.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.180
Their target was excellent.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.280
Too bad, Playmaker.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:27.420
Zaizen and Ghost Girl have 
become part of the Neuron Link.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.190
Zaizen...  Ghost Girl...

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:44.240
Human actions can’t affect me.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.850
Were you counting on a miracle?

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.380
Damn!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.800
I wasn’t counting on a miracle.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.920
I just believe in my friends!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.320
Playmaker…

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:06.480
But those friends are no longer around.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:11.030
Come!  The new card created from my will!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.530
Master Storm Access!

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:17.470
What?

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:20.070
The Skill's activation stopped.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.710
Why?  Wasn’t Zaizen defeated?

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.190
What’s going on?

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.710
What happened?

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.490
Zaizen…

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:47.490
Zaizen and Ghost Girl gave up their 
lives to destroy the Neuron Link.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.700
Zaizen!  Ghost Girl!

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.240
This is…

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:14.990
What's this?  I can see LINK VRAINS?

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.690
What’s going on?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.870
The Neuron Link stopped!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:25.340
Log out the people who are still conscious!

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:29.070
Zaizen!  Are you okay?

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.560
Zaizen!

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:37.720
Please answer, Zaizen!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:49.130
You said we couldn't win, but that was a lie!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:52.130
I won’t let the sacrifices go to waste!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:55.130
I will defeat you, Bohman!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:00.620
However!  Chimera Hydradrive 
Dragrid’s effect activates!

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.670
Judgment Dice!

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:12.020
What?  Light Attribute?

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.700
Luck has deserted you!

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:18.360
You can’t get rid of Clock Dragon!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.560
Playmaker!  Now!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.130
Battle!

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:29.670
Cyberse Clock Dragon attacks 
Chimera Hydradrive Dragrid!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.060
Go, Clock Dragon!

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.910
Pulse Pressure!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.090
All right!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.300
I end my turn.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.760
Now our LP are equal!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:05.510
Boss!  I think Playmaker is going to win!

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:09.470
No!  It’s too early to celebrate!

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:13.380
You're counting your frogs 
before they’ve hatched!

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:20.180
But you’re celebrating, Boss!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:23.150
Do your best, Playmaker!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:28.890
As Lightning said, the bond 
between humans is trouble.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:30.700
But!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.100
What?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.240
This is bad!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:47.040
The Neuron Link is being restored!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.480
This is my world.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.220
This level of damage can be quickly fixed.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:13:00.960
As long as I exist, the Neuron Link 
can be restored over and over.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:06.200
You can’t escape from the Neuron Link!

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.130
It didn’t work!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.970
Is there no way to stop him?

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.150
I won’t let you.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.350
Ai!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.150
Sorry, but I unlocked myself.

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:32.620
What are you doing, Ai?

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.170
Now’s the only chance!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:38.600
I won’t allow the Neuron 
Link to be restored!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:41.070
You’re going into the Neuron Link?

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:44.300
Now’s the only time I can 
destroy the Neuron Link!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:49.660
No way...  Is the Dark Ignis going to…

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:53.110
An AI will sacrifice itself for us?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.620
Why would you do this for humans?

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.530
Ai, don’t do it!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.740
Playmaker, I want to do this!

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:08.060
Even if I’m not around, you're 
connected to many people!

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.530
Pointless!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:20.720
You said that when you were alone, you 
only had a futile desire for revenge.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:23.910
That your views expanded by meeting friends!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:27.080
You’ve become stronger due to your bonds!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.950
Don’t be afraid to bond!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.250
Ai!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:36.610
You’re connected!

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:43.630
To Kusanagi, Soulburner, Blue Maiden, 
Revolver, Zaizen, Spectre, Ghost Girl.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:48.130
Flame, Aqua and… me!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.990
Playmaker!  Defeat Bohman!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.070
And save the world!

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.940
Even if I’m gone, don’t cry!

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:01.880
Bye, Playmaker!

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:12.320
Ai!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:21.700
My bro is gone.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.330
So that was self-sacrifice.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.670
But that will end as a pointless act.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.170
Pointless?

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:33.370
Because this will still end in your defeat.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.250
Don’t say that!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:38.650
I won’t forgive you for 
disparaging my partner!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.650
I won’t lose!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.890
I'll carry on Ai’s wishes and defeat you!

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:52.830
Even if your two wishes become one, it’s 
nothing compared to the giant one I've gathered.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.920
No, you’re wrong!

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:59.970
Wishes without bonds can’t defeat us!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:05.040
Then I’ll show you what 
humans do is pointless.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:07.810
This is the final turn!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:11.470
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.520
I activate the spell card, 
Hydradrive Readvent!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:23.200
By negating its effects, I can Special 
Summon a monster from my graveyard with lower ATK...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:27.770
...than the monster on your 
field with the highest ATK!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:31.500
Come, Chimera Hydradrive Dragrid!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:41.450
The Special Summoned monster is 
destroyed at the end of the turn.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:45.680
Boss!  That scary monster is back!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.340
Don’t lose your cool!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.650
Clock Dragon has more ATK than it!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:55.630
I activate the Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.890
He’s using it now!

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:04.200
Dragrid’s ATK are doubled.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:10.010
If it destroys Clock Dragon, 
Playmaker is certain to lose.

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:15.780
I’ll now show you why I said 
Ai’s sacrifice was pointless!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.350
I activate my Skill!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:19.080
What?

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:25.260
No way!  The Neuron Link was destroyed!

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.530
This is a Data Storm!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.190
This is my world!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:38.170
I can use this world as data 
to make up for shortcomings!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.070
It’s coming this way!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:53.380
No!  After sacrificing so 
much to stop the Neuron Link!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:57.090
By doing this, you're destroying this place!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:01.830
If that’s what it takes to defeat 
you, it’s a small price to pay.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:07.830
Come!  The new card created from my will!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.020
Master Storm Access!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:17.480
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.850
The summoning condition is 
at least one Link Monster!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:25.690
The embodiment of god carves a new history!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.320
Come, almighty dragon!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:30.490
Link Summon!

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:36.060
Link 5 Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon!

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:43.630
Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon’s effect!

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:47.100
I put five Hydradrive counters on it!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:56.480
And due to its additional effect, Perfectron 
gains 1000 ATK for each Hydradrive Counter.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.150
5000 ATK!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.830
This is bad!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.940
Bohman has Judgment Arrows on his field!

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:13.000
When he deals damage, 
Perfectron’s ATK will double.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:17.740
A single strike can defeat Playmaker.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.580
Battle!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:23.240
I activate the trap card, 
Return Risk Reservoir!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:28.680
It Special Summons a Level 
1 monster from my graveyard!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.650
Come, Protron!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:36.850
I activate Linkuriboh’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:41.520
It tributes Protron to Special Summon itself!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:50.130
Due to Return Risk Reservoir’s 
effect, I draw one card!

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:55.940
Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon 
attacks Cyberse Clock Dragon!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:20:00.140
I tribute Linkuriboh to activate its effect!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:05.620
Your monster’s ATK become 
0 until the end of the turn!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:11.590
Even with Judgment Arrows’s 
effect, it’ll remain at 0 ATK.

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:14.590
And Bohman will take big damage instead!

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.830
So Bohman will stop the battle!

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:21.770
I expected you to defend.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:24.800
I'll continue the battle!

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:32.240
Continue the battle?

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:33.780
That’s right.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:36.710
I would've stopped if 
this monster was Dragrid.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.530
Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon’s effect!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:44.200
Battle damage becomes 0!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:49.190
And by using one Hydradrive 
Counter, it's not destroyed.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.870
What was the point?

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:59.620
All he did was waste a Counter.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.170
What are you doing?

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.580
This, Playmaker!

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:11.470
When Perfectron Hydradrive Dragon battles, 
all your monsters are destroyed.

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:16.890
And you take 300 damage for every 
Hydradrive Link Monster in the graveyard!

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:18.360
What?

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.980
There are eight Hydradrive Link 
Monsters in the graveyard.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:25.830
Playmaker takes 2400 damage.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:37.840
I end my turn.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.470
Playmaker’s LP...

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:44.080
100 LP left.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:52.260
You managed to survive, but 
this match is over, Playmaker!

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:59.260
I won’t lose.

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:03.170
For Ai!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:09.590
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:17.040
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:24.010
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.980
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:34.520
The next sentimental

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:45.770
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:52.210
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:57.410
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:07.790
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:13.220
Are you ready?

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:18.570
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.090 --> 00:23:23.770
Are you ready?

00:23:24.390 --> 00:23:30.880
Are you ready?

00:23:38.400 --> 00:23:40.920
The last turn of destiny.

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:43.480
He has barely any LP left.

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:49.610
But no matter how many bad situations he's 
been in, Playmaker has never given up.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:54.680
He must win this duel for his fallen friends.

